interface.signature:
runFreeAgentSession(job, ctx): Promise<{ ok: true, claudeSessionId, costUsdDelta, turnCount } | { ok: false, reason }>
job.freeAgentSessionPayload: { sessionId: string, projectId: string, scope: { kind: 'project'|'plan'|'app'|'workspace', id?: string }, model: 'haiku' | 'sonnet' | 'opus' | string, costCapUsd: number, credentials: { accessKeyId, secretAccessKey, sessionToken, expiration }, messages: [{ role: 'user', content: string }] }
ctx: { pushEvent, sessionsRepo, conversationsRepo (Story 18.6), spawn (injectable for tests), now, logFn }
Behavior: acquire lock → ensure worktree + settings → spawn claude -p with --model/--max-budget-usd/--output-format stream-json/--session-id/--add-dir/--resume(N>0) → parse stream-json → emit free-agent.turn.* events → capture claudeSessionId on system.init → on close: release lock with appropriate next status. Watchdog at 600s. Cost-cap exit detection on non-zero+is_error+budget signal.

interface FreeAgentSession {
  sessionId: string;
  operatorId: string;
  projectId: string;
  scope: { kind: 'project' | 'plan' | 'app' | 'workspace'; id?: string };
  scopeIdComposite: string;  // GSI2 PK: `${scope.kind}#${scope.id ?? '_'}`
  status: 'ACTIVE' | 'PROCESSING' | 'IDLE' | 'EXPIRED' | 'BUDGET_EXHAUSTED' | 'ERROR';
  model: string;
  costCapUsd: number;
  costUsdAccumulated: number;
  claudeSessionId?: string;
  turnCount: number;
  createdAt: string;   // ISO-8601
  lastActivityAt: string;
  lastTurnAt?: string;
  lastRefreshedAt?: string;
  expiresAt: number;   // epoch seconds (DynamoDB TTL attribute)
  errorReason?: string;
}

Module-scoped state:
  let lastFreeAgentGcAt = 0;
  const FREE_AGENT_GC_INTERVAL_MS = Number(process.env.FREE_AGENT_GC_INTERVAL_MS) || 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;

Inside main poll loop, after writeHeartbeat():
  if (Date.now() - lastFreeAgentGcAt >= FREE_AGENT_GC_INTERVAL_MS) {
    lastFreeAgentGcAt = Date.now();
    runFreeAgentGc({
      querySessionsScan: () => sessionsRepo.listAllSessions(),
      logFn: (level, msg, ctx) => log(level, msg, ctx),
    }).catch((e) => log('error', `free-agent-gc uncaught: ${e.message}`));
  }
